# Nothing to set here: `npm run sbx -- dev` starts the sandbox with its own settings - its own database, its own keys
# (made once, kept in ~/.apsohub-sandbox/), and none of this terminal's keys or tokens. Nothing reaches anything real.
#
# Two switches it passes on when you set them in the terminal before `npm run sbx -- dev`:
# jobs to test, by name (src/lib/sandbox/boot.ts) - they still reach nothing real
SANDBOX_JOBS=
# "on" lets background AI reach Anthropic - only with a capped key of your own
SANDBOX_AI=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
